    <briefdescription>
<para>An owning RAII handle for a QuickJS-allocated C string. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The string must be allocated using QuickJS functions (JS_ToCString, JS_AtomToCString, etc.); it is released with JS_FreeCString when the handle is destroyed. The handle is move-only. Use <ref refid="classjac_1_1OwnedString_1a5f5080d959a1cd017b1fd5ece5e133a7" kindref="member">view</ref> to obtain a (non-owning) std::string_view for inspection. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
